title: "probst-diplomarbeit-cache-engine"
abstract: "Umbrella repository of the diploma thesis 'Active Cache-Aware Hardware Adaptation: Cache Engine for Trie-Based Index Structures' at Technische Universitaet Dresden: measurement driver, CSV/LaTeX pipeline, CI guards, documentation, vendored research literature; embeds the Comdare Cache Engine and PRT-ART as submodules."
